flowchart TD
    P[Loaded Program] --> I[Interpreter step loop]
    I --> H[Hotspot counter]
    H --> T{threshold reached}
    T -- no --> I
    T -- yes --> J[JitCompiler trace recording]
    J --> C[Compile JitTrace]
    C --> X[Trace execute with policy hook]
    X --> D{deopt/policy deny}
    D -- deopt --> I
    D -- deny --> F[SecurityFault]
    D -- completed --> I
